  "Name": "Final Fantasy XI Online: Seekers of Adoulin",
  "Overview": "Seekers of Adoulin is the fifth expansion for Final Fantasy XI Online.\n\nIt offers a variety of new features, such as monsters, areas in the lands of Ulbuka, and two additional jobs: Geomancer and Rune Seeker. It was released as a digital download for Windows. Only the Xbox360 version is available as physical media in North-America and Europe, but Japan has a physical release for PS2 as well.\n\nIt requires Final Fantasy XI Online and PlayOnline.",
